  title="Probate, state by state"
  description="Whether you need probate in Australia, which Supreme Court to apply to, the notice period and filing fee in each state and territory, how long it takes, and how long to wait before distributing an estate."
  lede="Probate is the Supreme Court confirming that a will is valid and that the executor is who they say they are. Many estates never need it."
